	I'm afraid I can't screen dump any of this horrid death, but
here goes my feeble account...
	I read a scroll of teleport and jump from level, oh, 11 to
level 30.  I'm working my way up fast when I polymorph into a Grey
Dragon!  That explains what that tiger eye ring was!  Okay, so I #sit.
I get a nice little grey dragon for a pet.  I go up.  I get blinded by
something, don't even remember, keep killing -- luckily I ate a
floating eye long ago.  I go up a level and find myself face to face
with a person symbol.  Grey elf, maybe? whatever.  Start swinging
stormy and see what happens.  I swing, I swing, I swing, OFF with her
head! indeed.  I step over the corpse to see what I killed and lo and
behold it's the snake lady herself.  he he he, glad I'm blind!  I take
one more step and step over "A statue of a rogue named gowen". Well,
that would be me from earlier!  I figure I'll bash it to try and get a
scroll book.  I #apply "O - a +0 pick-axe", and it asks what
direction. Well, I'm still standing on the statue, so I type '.'.

